SUMMARY:Nature Storytime: Forest Detectives
DESCRIPTION:Become a Forest Detective at our monthly Nature Storytime!\nEngage your sense of smell\, sight\, sound\, and wonder! This month’s story time will invite everyone to learn about the cycles and secrets of nature through nature stories\, nature games\, and a short ramble through the Williamson Nature Preserve trails. Join a TLC educator for this monthly story series where you can meet other families in your community and learn about nature. This month's nature stories are: "All Around Us" By Xelena Gomez and "Beneath" by Cori Doerrfeld. This program is designed for kids age 3-7 and their grownups. Please register all members of the family attending\, including children and adults:\n\n\n\nIf registration is full\, please email Meera Butalia at mbutalia@triangleland.org to be added to the waitlist.
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/nature-storytime-forest-detectives
LOCATION:Williamson Farm and Nature Preserve\, 4429 Old Country Mial Rd\, Raleigh\, 27610\, United States
END:VEVENT
