UID:10000084-1784971800-1784979000@triangleland.org
SUMMARY:Make Paper n' Nature
DESCRIPTION:Join TLC for this art & nature workshop!\nHave you ever wondered how paper is made? Have you ever wondered how you could make it? Discover how to live a more sustainable life by learning the ancient technique of paper making. Billions of trees are cut down every year but making your own paper from home helps to reduce the demand for virgin wood fiber. Meet us at Williamson Nature Preserve to give a tree another life! This is a free event for ages 12+\, but pre-registration is required. \n\nIf registration is full\, please email Meera Butalia at mbutalia@triangleland.org to be added to the waitlist.
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/make-paper-n-nature
LOCATION:Williamson Farm and Nature Preserve\, 4429 Old Country Mial Rd\, Raleigh\, 27610\, United States
END:VEVENT
