SUMMARY:Get Wild: Caterpillars Count!
DESCRIPTION:Join TLC for a bug-tastic adventure at Johnston Mill Nature Preserve! \nCaterpillars\, beetles\, and bugs are getting into the swing of summer just like us! Come investigate the crawlers of Johnston Mill with an insect search through the forest.  Explore how to safely catch and release insects for observation and learn what makes these tiny critters so special. Perfect for kids ages 7–10 and their grownups! This event is free\, but pre-registration is required:\n\n\n\nPlease email Meera Butalia at mbutalia@triangleland.org to be added to the waitlist if registration is full.
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/get-wild-caterpillars-count
LOCATION:Johnston Mill Preserve Secondary Entrance\, 6001 Turkey Farm Rd.\, Chapel Hill\, NC\, 27514\, United States
END:VEVENT
